/Title (The turbidity of water directly impacts the wildlife present in water areas. Indeed, with the decrease of sunlight,  algae and other water plants will not be able to perform photosynthesis correctly. Therefore, with some species depending on these plants to feed themselves, the overall population of living beings could collapse. This means a reduction of available food for ducks.)
